id: ops-b2bs
title: Verify the clean trusted release-tool build before daily release planning
description: "The original diagnosis predicted stale dist/ would first fail the candidate pack check. On the self-hosted release, prepare rebuilds the trusted tools from an empty dist/ and rejects drift before Decide release loads the planner. A separate candidate using current trusted tools rebuilds and commits its own dist/ and can pass the later pack check."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: "area:build","area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#295"
created_at: "2026-11-17T08:17:21.282Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-18T11:59:19.794Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-17T08:19:43.995Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-17T08:19:43.995Z"
author: pi-claude
repro_steps: "Merge a PR that changes daily-release.ts without rebuilding the tracked dist/, then run the next daily release."
resolution: Confirmed planner-order defect. Decide release imports the checked-out tools dist/daily-release.js before the candidate build. Prepare now rebuilds the trusted tools checkout and fails on tracked dist drift before loading the planner.
expected_result: "For the self-hosted reproduction, prepare rebuilds the trusted tools checkout at job.workflow_sha and fails on tracked dist/ drift in Verify trusted release tool build, before Decide release. Rebuild and commit dist/ on main before the next release. For a separate candidate repository with current trusted tools, the release rebuilds dist/, commits it in the release commit, and passes Pack verified release."
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-18T06:10:12.746Z",codex-sol,"Round BW: PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64zDCl maps to 1e51801. The prepare job rebuilds and checks the trusted tools dist before installer and planner loading. The workflow ordering regression passed. The original completion, closure and creation timestamps are preserved."
  "2026-11-18T07:30:50.329Z",codex-sol,Verified the prepare workflow checks out the tools at job.workflow_sha and runs the tracked dist diff before installing the planner tools and deciding the release.
  "2026-11-18T07:42:41.508Z",codex-sol,The trusted planner build ordering fixture passed on the review head. The expected result now records the self-hosted drift failure and the separate candidate-repository outcome.
  "2026-11-18T07:46:30.334Z",codex-sol,"Round BY: PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M640mQQ maps to 7056922. The expected result records the trusted workflow checkout failing on tracked dist drift before Decide release. The prepare ordering fixture passed."
  "2026-11-18T11:06:52.263Z",codex-sol,"Round CC addresses the trusted checkout, the job-local step ordering assertion and the original pack diagnosis. Historical completion is preserved."
  "2026-11-18T11:56:38.588Z",codex-sol,"Round CC implementation b780464 covers PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M643thG (clean trusted dist before building), PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M643th2 (prepare-local runtime-floor and nonnegative index), PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M643tg4 (correct the original pack diagnosis in the description) and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M643thS (correct the title and regenerate the release note). A real npm CI/build fixture proves the trusted drift check rejects an obsolete tracked artifact and leaves candidate output intact."
  "2026-11-18T11:59:06.547Z",codex-sol,"Round CC follow-up 8c8277e adds a real trust-boundary regression for PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M643thG. A clean trusted build passes, a tracked artifact deleted by the clean build fails before planning, and the candidate file is preserved. Creation, completion and closure fields match the starting revision."
